n  theory okay i'm getting a bit too  excited here about the upcoming value  reveal anyways what i actually wanted to  say is that i find it very strange that  appu is just casually walking up to  everyone here and distributing the  newspaper like okay maybe defeating  kaido and big mom has calmed kids rage  and nerves a little bit about being  betrayed but after everything we've  learned about him as a character you  would kind of expect him to like tear a  poo to pieces nonetheless after being  sold out by him and so kid's reaction  here seems off a little bit but maybe  he's just grown that much as a character  during the race or he maybe also is just  way too excited about his new bounty to  still care about a poo in that moment  right now here and then of course we do  have to discuss the preparations for the  big festival first of all i'm still over  the moon that yamato is pretty much  confirmed to be a straw hat at this  point seven days after the battle and  everyone in the crew everyone seems to  love her and treat her as a member  already the fact that she refused to eat  and move for like a week in order to  pray for luffy's health and safety is  just the cutest and most loyal thing  ever it's like a mini version of zorro's  sacrifice and willingness to take on  luffy's pain and suffer for his captain  love it and then the way she rushes in  and hugs luffy is also pure gold the  entire sequence honestly feels very much  like something that could have been  taken place on the sunny momo trying to  pull his usual move with nami and as  expected getting the sanji treatment in  return for it yamato placing a plate on  momo's head actually has him looking  exactly like his father odin i'm a real  sucker for stupid stuff like that it's  just my type of humor and we get a  second serving of the bath house scene  and i honestly think that at this point  oda sensei is either just living out his  wildest fantasies with yamato or is just  really trolling us as his 